---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import CtaRow from "../../components/CtaRow.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Gun store software is not one product | FFL Accelerator"
  description="People search “best software for a gun store” and get four different jobs in one pile. Your bound book is not your website. Your register is not your website. FFL Accelerator is the website."
  path="/guides/gun-store-software/"
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 sm:py-14">
    <p
      class="mb-3 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gold"
    >
      Guide
    </p>
    <h1 class="mb-4 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white">
      Gun store software is not one product
    </h1>
    <p class="mb-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-300">
      People search “best software for a gun store” and get four different
      jobs in one pile. Your bound book is not your website. Your register is
      not your website. FFL Accelerator is the website.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-lg font-semibold text-white">Four jobs</h2>
    <div class="mt-4 space-y-3">
      {
        [
          {
            t: "Records",
            d: "A&D book and Form 4473. Dedicated vendors and your counsel. Not us.",
          },
          {
            t: "The register",
            d: "The counter system you already run. That is sell-through. Keep it.",
          },
          {
            t: "The website",
            d: "The public store you own. WooCommerce, FFL checkout, optional distributor catalogs. That is FFL Accelerator.",
          },
          {
            t: "What they typed",
            d: "Searches on your site, including zeros. That is Betsy on the shop.",
          },
        ].map((b) => (
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950/50 p-5">
            <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">{b.t}</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-zinc-400">{b.d}</p>
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </div>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-lg font-semibold text-white">
      What we will not claim
    </h2>
    <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-sm text-zinc-400">
      <li>We do not fill out a 4473.</li>
      <li>We do not replace your bound book.</li>
      <li>We do not tell you to dump the register you already run.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-lg font-semibold text-white">
      If the gap is the website
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-400">
      You already have a register and a records system. The public site is
      still rented or dead. That is the $569 job.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-6">
      <CtaRow />
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
